# Stable deployment

`AGENTS.md` is authoritative.

- Update an existing environment with `create-version` plus `redeploy`; never create a replacement deployment.
- Verify the deployment ID points at the new version before success.
- Never print `CLASPRC_JSON`.
- Keep production manual, confirmation-protected, and behind required reviewers.
